---

# 🌱 AI-Powered Plant Health Monitoring App (React Native + MERN)

An AI-driven mobile application that diagnoses plant diseases, pests, and nutrient deficiencies using image recognition. The app provides real-time treatment recommendations and plant care guidance for gardeners and farmers.

Inspired by leading solutions like:

* Plantix
* Agrio
* Farmonaut

---

## 🚀 Tech Stack

### Frontend (Mobile)

* React Native (Expo or CLI)
* TypeScript
* Axios
* Native Camera & Image Picker
* UI Library (ShadCN-style components or React Native Paper)

### Backend (API)

* Node.js
* Express.js
* MongoDB (Mongoose)
* JWT Authentication
* Cloud Storage (AWS S3 / Cloudinary)

### AI Layer

* Python (FastAPI or Flask)
* TensorFlow / PyTorch model
* Image classification CNN
* REST API for predictions

---

## 🎯 Core Features

### 📷 AI Photo Diagnosis

* Upload plant leaf photos
* Detect:

  * Diseases
  * Pests
  * Nutrient deficiencies
* Confidence score per result

### 🌿 Plant Identification

* Recognize plant species
* Show care profile:

  * Water needs
  * Sunlight
  * Soil type

### 💊 Treatment Recommendations

* Organic remedies
* Chemical treatments
* Prevention tips

### 📊 Plant Health History

* Saved scans
* Progress tracking
* Before/after photos

### ⏰ Smart Reminders

* Watering schedule
* Fertilizing alerts
* Disease follow-up

---

## 🔐 Authentication & Users

* Email/Password login
* JWT protected routes
* User profiles
* Saved plants & scans

---

## 📦 Backend API Requirements

### Auth

```
POST /auth/register
POST /auth/login
```

### Plants

```
POST /plants/add
GET /plants/user
DELETE /plants/:id
```

### AI Diagnosis

```
POST /ai/predict
```

### History

```
GET /history
POST /history/save
```

---

## 🧠 AI Model Requirements

### Input

* JPG/PNG plant images

### Output

```json
{
  "plant": "Tomato",
  "disease": "Leaf Blight",
  "confidence": 0.94,
  "treatment": ["Neem oil spray", "Remove infected leaves"]
}
```

### Model Goals

* 90%+ accuracy
* Trained on public plant disease datasets
* Lightweight for fast inference

