# 🧠 Core Modules (LLD Breakdown)

---

## 1️⃣ Authentication Module

### User Schema

```js
User {
  _id: ObjectId
  name: String
  email: String (unique)
  password: String (hashed)
  role: "user" | "admin"
  createdAt
}
```

### APIs

| Method | Endpoint       | Description    |
| ------ | -------------- | -------------- |
| POST   | /auth/register | Create account |
| POST   | /auth/login    | Login          |
| GET    | /auth/profile  | User info      |

---

## 2️⃣ Plant Management Module

### Plant Schema

```js
Plant {
  _id: ObjectId
  userId: ObjectId
  name: String
  species: String
  sunlight: String
  waterFrequency: String
  createdAt
}
```

### APIs

| Method | Endpoint    | Description     |
| ------ | ----------- | --------------- |
| POST   | /plants     | Add plant       |
| GET    | /plants     | Get user plants |
| DELETE | /plants/:id | Remove plant    |

---

## 3️⃣ Scan & AI Diagnosis Module

### ScanHistory Schema

```js
ScanHistory {
  _id: ObjectId
  userId: ObjectId
  plantId: ObjectId
  imageUrl: String
  disease: String
  confidence: Number
  treatment: [String]
  createdAt
}
```

---

### AI Flow (Important LLD Logic)

```
User uploads image
      ↓
Backend stores image (Cloudinary/S3)
      ↓
Backend calls AI microservice
      ↓
AI returns diagnosis JSON
      ↓
Backend saves result in MongoDB
      ↓
Response sent to app
```

---

### APIs

| Method | Endpoint      | Description             |
| ------ | ------------- | ----------------------- |
| POST   | /scan         | Upload image & diagnose |
| GET    | /scan/history | Past scans              |

---

# 🤖 AI Microservice (Separate Server)

### Tech:

* Python + FastAPI
* CNN Model

### Endpoint:

```
POST /predict
```

### Input:

```json
{
  "imageUrl": "https://..."
}
```

### Output:

```json
{
  "plant": "Tomato",
  "disease": "Leaf Blight",
  "confidence": 0.94,
  "treatment": [
    "Neem oil spray",
    "Remove infected leaves"
  ]
}
```

---

# 🔐 Security Design

✅ JWT authentication
✅ Password hashing (bcrypt)
✅ Role-based access (future admin panel)
✅ Rate limiting (scan API)

---

# 📦 Database Relationships

```
User 1 ────> many Plants
User 1 ────> many ScanHistory
Plant 1 ───> many ScanHistory
```

---

# ⚙️ Key Backend Services (LLD Level)

### ai.service.js

* sendImageToAI()
* parsePrediction()

### upload.service.js

* uploadToCloud()
* getPublicUrl()

---

# 🚀 Performance Design

| Area      | Solution                |
| --------- | ----------------------- |
| Heavy AI  | Separate Python service |
| Images    | CDN storage             |
| DB        | Indexed userId          |
| API speed | Async queues (future)   |

---

# 📊 Error Handling

Global middleware:

```js
{
  status: false,
  message: "Something went wrong",
  code: 500
}
```

